          "response": {
            "status": 200,
            "body": "{\"articles\":[{\"author_id\":39771704393373,\"body\":\"Homebuy International Gift Cards have helped decorate many homes across the world. Gift cards are good for 2 years from the date they were sent to the recipient via the Homebuy website or, if you directly emailed the gift card to the recipient, then from its initial date of purchase.<p>This generous time frame provides enough to browse through collections, imagine new furnishings in a space, take measurements, and find the perfect items.</p><p>We understand that, occasionally, timing can be a challenge. If you have a gift card close to its expiration and anticipate a furnishing need just beyond the horizon, don’t fret. Connect with us and we can explore options to extend your gift card.</p><p>Our priority is your satisfaction as you craft your dream space with Homebuy Furniture.</p>\",\"comments_disabled\":false,\"content_tag_ids\":[],\"created_at\":\"2026-10-08T21:14:32Z\",\"draft\":true,\"edited_at\":\"2026-10-08T21:14:32Z\",\"html_url\":\"https://stealth-37618.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/39771697329949-SAMPLE-ARTICLE-Gift-card-expiration-date\",\"id\":39771697329949,\"label_names\":[],\"locale\":\"en-us\",\"name\":\"SAMPLE ARTICLE: Gift card expiration date\",\"outdated\":false,\"outdated_locales\":[],\"permission_group_id\":39771696447005,\"position\":0,\"promoted\":true,\"section_id\":39771706684573,\"source_locale\":\"en-us\",\"title\":\"SAMPLE ARTICLE: Gift card expiration date\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-12T12:07:35Z\",\"url\":\"https://stealth-37618.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/39771697329949.json\",\"user_segment_id\":null,\"vote_count\":0,\"vote_sum\":0}],\"count\":1,\"end_time\":1791806855,\"next_page\":null}",
